@id n2_cole
# DRAFT
# Cole keeping the gate at dusk (night 2). Silent: a word or two at most, and a look.
# If the merchant drowned, there's pond weed drying on his boots: he helped pull him out, or so it would seem.
== start
(Cole in the gate's arch, as he was last night. He looks at you a long moment.)
-> weed [if died_merchant]
-> topics

== weed
(There's green weed from the pond drying on his boots.)
-> topics

== again
(Cole looks at you and says nothing.)
-> topics

== topics
* [if not n2_cole_take] I'll take the gate after supper. -> take
* [if not n2_cole_today] Did anyone come to the gate today? -> today

== take [set n2_cole_take]
Cole {blank}: After supper.
-> topics

== today [set n2_cole_today]
(He shakes his head once.)
-> topics

== leave
(Cole watches you go.)
